From a050b88c18dffe7eeccabbbe16b18ee7a2373f56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DENIS20110604 <akount.den11@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:48:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Offline play and Ely.by accounts

- no owner gate: offline names, accounts without a licence, Mojang downloads
- ely.rs: authlib authenticate/refresh/validate, accounts with an authlib server
- ely_proxy.rs: loopback discovery document forwarding join/verify/profile
- self-update off (the official update would restore the gate)
